WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.055 line:90%
That story makes the pressure visible. It is a
teaching story from the book, not

00:00:05.055 --> 00:00:08.000 line:90%
a claim about a current customer. Keep that
distinction in view as we move between

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.254 line:90%
But the list does not tell you which problem to
solve first, and it cannot tell you why.

00:00:13.254 --> 00:00:16.000 line:90%
That is the trap in the chapter.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:19.446 line:90%
One person says the service is slow.

00:00:19.446 --> 00:00:22.911 line:90%
Another says it is hard to start.

00:00:22.911 --> 00:00:24.000 line:90%
Someone wants a reminder.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:32.000 line:90%
When they examined the moment behind it, they
found different needs: immediate confirmation
after an action, current information from other
people, and easier movement between views.
